b) TO GET THE INPUT DATE, CURRENT DATE AND THE DIFFERENCE IN DAYS
BETWEEN THEM
scala> import org.apache.spark.sql.functions._
scala> Seq(("2019-01-23"),("2019-06-24"),("2019-09-20"))
scala> .toDF("input")
scala> .select( col("input"), current_date(),
| datediff(current_date(),col("input")).as("diff")
| ).show()
c) TO GET THE INPUT DATE, CURRENT DATE AND THE DIFFERENT IN DAYS AND
ALSO MONTHS BETWEEN THEM
scala> import org.apache.spark.sql.functions._
scala> Seq(("2019-01-23"),("2019-06-24"),("2019-09-20"))
scala> .toDF("date")
scala> .select( col("date"), current_date(),
| datediff(current_date(),col("date")).as("datediff"),
| months_between(current_date(),col("date")).as("months_between")
| ).show()

